  <item>
    <title>Vol.34 春风沉醉的夜晚，如果你途经长寿路和锦尚西三路，请停下脚步，看看花树。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/661f983a48c40e2fb0e94184</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">661f983a48c40e2fb0e94184</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Apr 2024 09:36:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg71dQ_68gGaZY2Zi1l_z9Wgzfi8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>植物带给人的抚慰都是最直接，最纯粹的。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft_uBBKq_bDvNCxNyR5Mn5XeD-Np.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>所以春天的我们，常常怀有一点不安，天气多变幻，一惊一乍，亦忧亦喜，不知道春天什么时候就突然没了。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FupXop7ulm_dgc5QKPmhAO_3LVc-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>每到四月就特别想要珍惜，却不知道怎么珍惜才好。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs9Je3KAHuc_5KzEfQVEH24P-iCi.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>很神奇，春风一吹，连头发都变得开心，走在路上，心里好像有什么在涌动着。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgD_AupswdwO5_KJzuDyM2LIbXaM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【互动方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 微博： @子寒ann</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 微信公众号/小红书：你听子寒吗</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/556da186e58d134d489acba7" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/556da186e58d134d489acba7"><span>www.xiaohongshu.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
